  /but you slip back down/i,
  /you fail to pick the lock/i,
  /and fall off it/i,
  /you fall in to the rat pit/i,
  /but you slip and tumble into the darkness/i,
  /you try to swing but fall in to the darkness/i,
  /and fail, activating the trap/i
